recommend keep-going ALES21 can carry markers into real time through the ALES5 clock (the twin of loop.mark_ms), or offer the choice of pan/crossfade law where a crossfade meets a marked edit — both agent-doable, no custody gate. A punch region armed between two markers, tying playback to the Mikrophone's capture, is a module seam that waits for Keaton's word.
